{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L0tpbmclMjBPZiUyMENyaW1lJTIwJTI4MjAxOCUyOS8","type":"movie","name":"King Of Crime","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/4oXaELJlnk3sm22xuR6oGTZ7lEv.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gRnDpk9XI8CNqcOQ6RnkAsLWZQt.jpg","description":"Marcus King, an old school gangster, a crime lord, has left behind old school crime. He has manoeuvred his business into the leafy lanes of the suburbs and now, in place of pimps and dealers, his team consists of the best graduate geeks that money can bribe. No brothels, no casinos and no drugs - he's dragged serious, organised crime well and truly into the twenty-first century. From credit card cloning and skimming to Internet spamming and scamming, he is the king of Cyber Land.","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Crime","Drama","Thriller","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.5","runtime":"102 min","cast":["Mark Wingett","Claire King","Rachel Bright","Nicholas Brendon","Vas Blackwood","Jonno Davies","Christopher Ellison","Francesca Louise White"],"director":["Matt Gambell"],"released":"2018-11-02T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Old school criminals. New school crimes.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Mark Wingett","character":"Marcus King","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uT3QCwMDSXw6FJdTBTpBNJnDFZS.jpg"},{"name":"Claire King","character":"Yvonne King","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/etkjljWNcaLEe0sbT1bcwnb4Rd5.jpg"},{"name":"Rachel Bright","character":"Jessica Slade","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aA3wErFKq79HZsJfzivPk8zCahP.jpg"},{"name":"Nicholas Brendon","character":"Brad Walsh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6O5sg97Fv07EzdWjpoq3lb8KnTM.jpg"},{"name":"Vas Blackwood","character":"Mr. Mustaffa","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7xxlJe5O9SyPLH0tXIK7WLd2iB1.jpg"},{"name":"Jonno Davies","character":"Andrew King","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/oI68xvcPqZjRIfteTbtT3jAVUV1.jpg"},{"name":"Christopher Ell